   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>适合儿童的舒适布置&nbsp;</strong>在客厅里，为孩子们提供专属的椅子，让他们始终拥有家的感觉。“Frieda非常喜欢她的椅子，经常窝在里面玩或者阅读。”</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "使用舒适的休闲毯、靠垫和灯光。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/84/88/8488cc3e969ff8a6958bc636098e9a49.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
