     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>打造一块舒适的角落&nbsp;</strong>L型沙发上放着休闲毯和靠垫，再布置好温馨的灯光，就变成了一处舒适的休憩之地。“我们喜欢在冬季营造格外温馨的气氛。”</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "开放式布局，让你享受更多家庭时光。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/ef/81/ef81fe6bf549ffa4c64a32c239631b16.jpg"
